  unitName: Earth Pot
  unitId: 30191
  unitNumber: 308
  description: A curious creature that lives in a pot which is said to hold a power
    capable of dramatically changing the properties of earth. It's said that Earth
    Pots were used as cooking pots by chefs in the past, the trauma of which has
    left them fearful of coming in contact with fire. The lack of interest they have
    in how highly they're sought after by Summoners nowadays have left modern chefs
    wondering exactly how badly they were treated by chefs before.
  summonDesc: Wait! WAIT!<br>Keep that fire away from me!<br>I don't wanna get burned!
